cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "TECAN Growth Curve Analysis Pipeline"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Turns a TECAN Spark plate-reader export into modified-Gompertz growth
  parameters (A, mu, lambda, doubling time) with explicit GOOD/BAD quality
  gates, a Streamlit lab interface and a scripted batch pipeline.
repository-code: "https://github.com/dbold23/TECAN-Growth-Curve-Analysis-Pipeline"
license: MIT
